  "notes": [
    "The report `status` property is typed as a free-form string in the specification; the specification's own createReport response example uses the literal value \"Completed\". The terminal/non-terminal status vocabulary recorded in docs/contract.json under `asyncLifecycle` is the behaviour the pinned mock in harness/mock_server.py implements, and is marked there as fixture behaviour rather than as a schema constraint.",
    "The specification declares the security scheme `Token-based-authorization` as an apiKey carried in the `Authorization` header but does not spell out the header's value grammar. docs/contract.json fixes that grammar under `auth.headerValueTemplate` and flags it as a contract-local convention; the mock enforces exactly that grammar."
